      "instance_name": "hateful_attack",
      "label": "Hateful Attack",
      "description": "This meme constitutes a hateful attack by using extreme, violent, and grotesque imagery (comparing someone to Jeffrey Dahmer) to smear a public figure's character. It is designed to incite outrage and delegitimize the subject by associating her with the most horrific criminal acts imaginable, without factual basis.",
