      "description": "The meme leverages misogynistic tropes by attacking a woman's moral character and competence through violent and degrading imagery. It implies that women are inherently less capable or more prone to hidden corruption, aligning with stereotypes that diminish women's credibility and moral standing.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
